  "priorExpiration": "2005-07-03",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 908.01 Financial Responsibility. Every motor carrier operating motor vehicles transporting passengers or property in interstate commerce shall comply with the minimum levels of financial responsibility for carriers set forth in 49 CFR 387, and every motor carrier transporting hazardous materials interstate or intrastate, shall comply with the minimum levels of financial responsibility for carriers set forth in 49 CFR 387.9.\n\nSource. #2705, eff 5-9-84; ss by #4824, eff 6-1-90; ss by #4980, eff 11-16-90; ss by #6353, eff 10-11-96, EXPIRED: 10-11-04\n\nNew. #8247, INTERIM, eff 1-4-05, EXPIRED: 7-3-05\n\nNew. #8404, eff 8-2-05 (from Saf-C 907.01); ss by #10215, eff 10-25-12; ss by #13684, eff 7-17-23",
